	<key>readme</key>
	<string>fzf-alfred v4 — pure-shell fuzzy file navigation.

Two keywords:
• fzfnav &lt;query&gt; — fuzzy search files and folders
• fzfdir &lt;query&gt; — fuzzy search folders only

Keys on a result:
• Enter      — open
• ⌘ Enter    — reveal in Finder
• ⌥ Enter    — open a Terminal/iTerm window in the item's folder
• ⌃ Enter    — copy the full path
• ⌘ L        — Large Type (Alfred built-in)
• ⌘ Y        — Quick Look (Alfred built-in)

Requires fd, fzf and eza (e.g. `brew install fd fzf eza`).</string>
